Nastart Agent — installation notice

This package downloads the Nastart Agent container image from Docker Hub.
It uses Synology Container Manager to start the Agent and its filtered
Docker socket proxy through its Docker Project Worker. The Agent
provides HTTPS on TCP port 8787. The Agent's private state is stored in
DSM's persistent package data directory.

This notice does not change the licensing terms for Nastart Agent,
Synology Container Manager, or the downloaded image and its components.
